{id="t0048-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fortify before the treatment",body="Farm log: “fortify here” meant boards over the garden door before the next treatment truck. The crew promised to collect its sample jars and never returned.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=1}},
{id="t0048-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="First heart, clean cot",body="Diary margin: the first heart marks the cot where the orchard crew slept after the spray run. Their boots left a sweet yellow dust; the family returned before anyone posted a warning.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=2}},
{id="t0048-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second heart, rinsed blanket",body="On the photograph back: second heart, our spare blanket. I rinsed green flecks from it after the seed-treatment men left, then the well began tasting of pennies.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=3}},
{id="t0048-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Third heart, borrowed room",body="Torn notebook page: the third heart is the room lent to two pasture-test workers. One wrote that the calves refused water before the county cars arrived.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=4}},
{id="t0048-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fourth heart, sealed window",body="Personal note: at the fourth heart we shut the window during the field misting. The kitchen herbs curled by supper, hours before the road patrol appeared.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=5}},
{id="t0048-07",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fifth heart, empty cradle",body="Letter draft: the fifth heart was for the baby room. A crop-trial driver warned us not to use the rain barrel, but would not put his warning on the delivery slip.",anchor={map="IrvingtonStashMap9",note=6}},
