{id="t0112-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fuel needed for a second pass",body="Notebook line under “you’ll need it”: reserve another can for the second pasture pass. The first crew came home coughing before any emergency convoy used the road.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap3",note=2}},
-- T0113
{id="t0113-01",kind="set",pieces={"Tissue","FirstAidKit"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the packet of tissues",body="the packet of tissues and first-aid kit were sealed together but never opened. soot darkens the bundle; clean outlines show it was packed before the fire.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap4",mark=1}},
-- T0114
{id="t0114-01",kind="set",pieces={"Bag_ALICEpack","SeedBag"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Supplies kept out of sight",body="A pack of supplies is hidden with the field bag; a note asks the next visitor to keep the watchers from seeing the unopened test kit.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap5",mark=1}},
-- T0115
{id="t0115-01",kind="set",pieces={"Candle","Clipboard"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the candle",body="matching white stripes cross the candle and clipboard. a name-sized patch on the candle has been scrubbed bare.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",mark=1}},
{id="t0115-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Cross beside the trial store",body="Photograph back: the cross marks the store used by the crop trial. One sample crate was removed before the inventory and left a blue outline on the floor.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",mark=2}},
{id="t0115-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Supplies at the first written mark",body="Torn page: there should be sampling jars and boot covers here. The crop crew left them when two workers developed rashes and the planned collection was cancelled.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",note=1}},
{id="t0115-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Too large for one field crew",body="Personal farm log: “too big to secure” was the old packing floor. The trial team used only one bay, yet fresh powder reached the locked bays overnight.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",note=2}},
{id="t0115-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Cross checked after the seed delivery",body="Receipt margin: count the sealed seed sacks again at the cross. The driver signed for twelve, while only eleven appear on the field tally.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",note=3}},
{id="t0115-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Initials beside the plot count",body="On a faded photograph: the handwritten name by the cross belonged to the man counting treated rows. His tally ends one row before the plants turned black.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap6",note=4}},
-- T0116
{id="t0116-01",kind="set",pieces={"Bandage","WaterBottle"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fill before the building empties",body="The water bottle is tagged for the infected area, but the field note says to fill it before the next crew enters. A bandage wrapper is folded around the cap.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap7",mark=1}},
-- T0117
{id="t0117-01",kind="set",pieces={"Notebook","Pencil"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="A destination without a name",body="The route page is complete except for its destination. The departure box is checked, and a margin asks the driver to wait for an updated order.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap8",mark=1}},
-- T0118
{id="t0118-01",kind="set",pieces={"Notebook","SheetPaper2"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Crates without contents",body="A crate tally includes the offices but lists no contents; the next page labels the same shipment for a field check.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",mark=1}},
{id="t0118-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Crates reserved for field samples",body="Warehouse note: keep the empty crates for soil cores from the southern trial farms. Three returned damp and smelling of solvent, though the manifest lists them unused.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=1}},
{id="t0118-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Railyard pickup before dawn",body="Diary entry: the railyard pickup carried seed sacks and rinse drums before dawn. By breakfast the switchman’s eyes burned; the public closure came later.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=2}},
{id="t0118-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Muldraugh route crossed out",body="Driver’s torn page: the Muldraugh route was crossed out after the field team reported foam in the drainage ditch. No replacement destination appears.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=3}},
{id="t0118-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Muldraugh field route in the margin",body="Driver’s diary: beside the Muldraugh label, the return route from the southern trial farms is written in pencil. Two stops are rubbed out, but their sample counts remain.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=4}},
{id="t0118-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Office ledger with no owner",body="Notebook from the offices: four crop-test invoices, no company name, all paid in cash. A pencil note says the county men collected the carbon copies.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=5}},
{id="t0118-07",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Warehouse bay washed twice",body="Cleaning receipt: warehouse bay three was washed twice after storing pasture-treatment drums. The second wash is billed before the first crew signed out.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=6}},
{id="t0118-08",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Trains idle after the shipment",body="Personal rail log: none of the trains would start after the trial shipment arrived. The same oily grit coated each air intake, but the repair report calls it ordinary dust.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap9",note=7}},
-- T0119
{id="t0119-01",kind="set",pieces={"Matches","HandTorch"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the box of matches",body="the box of matches and hand torch smell sharply of bleach. mud outlines between them show that a third object was removed.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",mark=1}},
{id="t0119-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Clothes bag from the test rows",body="Laundry receipt: coveralls from the second circle carried orange pollen from the test rows. The clerk noted numb fingers before patrol cars reached the highway.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",mark=2}},
{id="t0119-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Lunch stop for the field crew",body="Meal receipt back: six lunches went to the greenhouse crew at the third circle. Two were untouched; beside them someone wrote, “metal taste after noon spray.”",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",mark=3}},
{id="t0119-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Cars rinsed behind the garage",body="Photograph note: the fourth circle shows where three field cars were hosed down. Pale foam ran toward the ditch while the garage was still open to families.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",mark=4}},
{id="t0119-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fuel for the orchard rig",body="Pocket ledger: gas at this circle was charged to the orchard rig, not the relief trucks. The return mileage exceeds the marked field route by forty miles.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=1}},
{id="t0119-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Coveralls kept off the invoice",body="Torn note under the clothes label: bag the trial coveralls separately and leave them off the laundry invoice. My wrists blistered while tying the second bag.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=2}},
{id="t0119-07",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Field lunches at the restaurant",body="Receipt from the marked restaurant: lunches for the crop crew, plus soap and bottled water. A handwritten line says the tap smelled sharp before closing.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=3}},
{id="t0119-08",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fleet note with one car missing",body="Farm-program mileage page: four cars left for the plots, three returned for washing. The blank driver line is dated before the county barricade went up.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=4}},
{id="t0119-09",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Car label beside a field rinse bill",body="Garage receipt at the car label: rinse three crop-study vehicles and keep the fourth outside. The fourth plate is the only one copied into the county log.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=5}},
{id="t0119-10",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Final circle after the convoy left",body="Notebook line at the final circle: one trial car returned after the others had gone. Its seats were dusted white and its mileage page had been removed.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap10",note=6}},
-- T0120
{id="t0120-01",kind="set",pieces={"RadioReceiver","SheetPaper2"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="A signal sent for testing",body="The radio test sheet says the signal dropped at the tower; the technician’s note asks the field crew to check power before changing equipment.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",mark=1}},
{id="t0120-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Dish three carried plot readings",body="Personal service note: dish three on tower two relayed moisture readings from the trial plots. The signal vanished during the night application, before any public emergency traffic.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",note=1}},
{id="t0120-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Power dip during the field pass",body="Torn meter log: near six gigahertz, power dipped as the spraying crew entered the eastern field. The station batteries were full and no storm was recorded.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",note=2}},
{id="t0120-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Test request with samples attached",body="Letter draft: ask headquarters to compare the Lexington receiver with two leaf samples. The samples carry the same gray film found inside the tower cabinet.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",note=3}},
{id="t0120-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Sun mark over the crop receiver",body="Photograph back at the sun mark: the crop-weather receiver is lit, but its plot channel reads blank. The operator noted a chemical smell inside the cabinet.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",note=4}},
{id="t0120-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Cross placed over the test receiver",body="Technician’s notebook: the cross marks the receiver used for crop-weather telemetry. It failed whenever the treated field pump ran, then recovered after the pump stopped.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap11",note=5}},
-- T0121
{id="t0121-01",kind="set",pieces={"Pills","WaterBottle"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="Camp supplies minus one person",body="The camp list counts water and medicine but leaves one person’s pickup line blank. A note asks whether the missing dose is still at the main office.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap12",mark=1}},
-- T0122
{id="t0122-01",kind="set",pieces={"LetterHandwritten","SeedBag"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="You have to leave",body="A seed bag is wrapped in a letter asking someone to leave before the field crew returns. The writer says the route is safer if no one waits at the door.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap13",mark=1}},
-- T0123
{id="t0123-01",kind="set",pieces={"Lighter","BathTowel"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the lighter",body="red and blue cord join the lighter to the bath towel. the red route is cut; the blue route ends in a sealed knot.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap14",mark=1}},
-- T0124
{id="t0124-01",kind="set",pieces={"Notebook","WaterBottle"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="The garden page",body="A water bottle rests on a garden record whose test result is missing. The last instruction says not to water until the next visit.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap15",mark=1}},
-- T0125
{id="t0125-01",kind="set",pieces={"Extinguisher","Camera"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the fire extinguisher",body="chalk numbers run across the fire extinguisher and camera. the count skips one place, then resumes in a different hand.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",mark=1}},
{id="t0125-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="First trap held a torn field tag",body="Diary line at the first trap: a torn pasture-test tag was caught beneath the spring. Its number belongs to a drum the return ledger calls sealed.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=1}},
{id="t0125-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Camp used by the pasture team",body="Camp log: the pasture-study team slept here for three nights. On the fourth morning their cook poured out the water because it smelled medicinal.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=2}},
{id="t0125-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="North arrow past the wash drums",body="Field diary: the first north arrow leads past drums used to wash pasture-test gear. One drum was already sealed when the checkpoint crew arrived.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=3}},
{id="t0125-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second trap held a sample bag",body="Photograph back: the second trap contained a torn soil-sample bag, not an animal. Blue granules beneath it matched the coating on the trial seed.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=4}},
{id="t0125-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Checkpoint checked field badges",body="Personal note from the checkpoint: wave through the green field badges before recording civilian plates. I copied one badge number after its wearer began shaking.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=5}},
{id="t0125-07",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Barriers moved after the spill",body="Road-crew receipt: barriers were moved downhill after a trial drum leaked. The billed time is two hours before the radio announced an emergency route.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=6}},
{id="t0125-08",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Upper arrow toward the trial gate",body="Torn page: follow the upper north arrow to the trial gate and count every rinse can. The crew counted seven going in and six coming back.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap16",note=7}},
-- T0126
{id="t0126-01",kind="set",pieces={"Camera","Notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Photographs from the blind spot",body="A camera is packed with a field notebook that says to photograph the blind side of the fence; the sensor check is marked complete before the crew arrives.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap17",mark=1}},
-- T0127
{id="t0127-01",kind="set",pieces={"AlcoholWipes","Briefcase"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="containment",rival="agricultural"}},title="missing count beside the alcohol wipes",body="the alcohol wipes and briefcase are wrapped in a child's raincoat. one stayed dry while the other was left in road mud.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",mark=1}},
{id="t0127-02",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="First fire under the assay table",body="Farm diary: the first fire started beneath the assay table after a field sample cracked. The wet soil burned blue before any building caught.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=1}},
{id="t0127-03",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second fire, scorched assay tray",body="Diary entry: beside the second fire mark lay a scorched tray from the soil assay. Its unburned label says the orchard batch was reapplied after rain.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=2}},
{id="t0127-04",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Third fire, seed sacks first",body="Photograph back: the third fire began among returned seed sacks, not the nearby lumber. Violet grains remained in the seams after the flames went out.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=3}},
{id="t0127-05",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fourth fire beside the rinse pit",body="Farm log: smoke at the fourth fire rose from the rinse pit after the trial crew emptied its hoses. The grass died in a clean ring before dusk.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=4}},
{id="t0127-06",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fifth fire after the drum split",body="Torn notebook page: the fifth fire followed a split treatment drum. Water spread the burning film, so we covered it with field soil and left.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=5}},
{id="t0127-07",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Sixth fire on the sample route",body="Receipt margin: replace two boots burned at the sixth fire on the sampling route. Both soles carried the same sticky amber residue.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=6}},
{id="t0127-08",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Seventh fire at the hay edge",body="Letter draft: the seventh fire caught damp hay where the pasture spray settled. The extension worker asked us to call it a lantern accident.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=7}},
{id="t0127-09",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Eighth fire before sunrise",body="Diary line: the eighth fire glowed before sunrise around bags from the night application. No homes were burning and no siren had sounded.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=8}},
{id="t0127-10",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Ninth fire by the drainage cut",body="Photograph note: the ninth fire follows the drainage cut from the experimental plot. Frogs floated below it while the bank still smoked.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=9}},
{id="t0127-11",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Tenth fire under the sprayer",body="Maintenance page: the tenth fire blackened the parked sprayer from beneath. The fuel line was intact; dried treatment foam covered the hot shield.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=10}},
{id="t0127-12",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Eleventh fire and empty cages",body="Personal note: after the eleventh fire, every test cage stood open. The rabbits were gone, but their water pans held white crystals.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=11}},
{id="t0127-13",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Twelfth fire at the row flags",body="Farm diary: the twelfth fire consumed only the flagged crop rows. Untreated rows on either side stayed green until the next rain.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=12}},
{id="t0127-14",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Thirteenth fire behind the shed",body="Feed receipt back: at the thirteenth fire we found six empty additive tins behind the shed. The purchase line lists five.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=13}},
{id="t0127-15",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fourteenth fire along wet ground",body="Notebook sketch: the fourteenth fire crawled across wet ground in the same path as yesterday’s trial runoff. Ordinary straw would not burn there.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=14}},
{id="t0127-16",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fifteenth fire and the buried jar",body="Letter fragment: beneath the fifteenth fire mark I buried a sealed leaf jar. Its leaves spotted black before the heat reached them.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=15}},
{id="t0127-17",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Sad face after the field meal",body="Diary line at the sad face: the field cook wept when three workers could not swallow lunch. All had handled the new grain coating that morning.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=16}},
{id="t0127-18",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Gun beside the locked sample case",body="Photograph back at the first gun: a guard watched the sample case while the sick applicator waited outside. The case left before the ambulance came.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=17}},
{id="t0127-19",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Happy face on the bonus sheet",body="Pay-envelope note at the first happy face: bonus for completing the late spray despite complaints. My hands were numb when I signed.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=18}},
{id="t0127-20",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="First dead face, stained gloves",body="Torn diary page: at the first dead face, stained gloves remained beside a crop-trial badge. The public list later called the wearer an unknown traveler.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=19}},
{id="t0127-21",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second dead face by the well",body="Notebook line: the second dead face marks the well tender who sampled cloudy water for the pasture study. His bottle disappeared before dawn.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=20}},
{id="t0127-22",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Third dead face near clean corn",body="Photograph note: the third dead face lies beside corn that looks untouched. A trial flag was pulled from the row but its wire hole remains.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=21}},
{id="t0127-23",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fourth dead face on the truck path",body="Mileage slip back: the fourth dead face was found on the field truck path. Tire tracks lead away before the road closure begins.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=22}},
{id="t0127-24",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Fifth dead face and the wash basin",body="Diary entry: the fifth dead face is beside the crew wash basin. The water smelled of bleach and the rinse ledger had been torn out.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=23}},
{id="t0127-25",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Sixth dead face under orchard netting",body="Torn letter: at the sixth dead face, orchard netting covered a man still wearing sample tags. The fruit above him had split without ripening.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=24}},
{id="t0127-26",kind="written",pieces={"diary"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Seventh dead face at the feed cart",body="Receipt note: the seventh dead face fell beside feed mixed for the supplement trial. The cart number is absent from the barn account.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=25}},
{id="t0127-27",kind="written",pieces={"notepad"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Eighth dead face beyond the flags",body="Personal map note: the eighth dead face lay beyond the last trial flag, where the wind carried the mist. Officials later measured only inside the flags.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=26}},
{id="t0127-28",kind="written",pieces={"receipt"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Ninth dead face and the sealed flask",body="Notebook page: a sealed flask beside the ninth dead face contains green field water. The label asks for testing, but no laboratory is named.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=27}},
{id="t0127-29",kind="written",pieces={"photograph"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second happy face on a clean report",body="Photograph back at the second happy face: the supervisor held up a clean inspection sheet while smoke rose behind the trial rows.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=28}},
{id="t0127-30",kind="written",pieces={"notebook"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second gun guarding rinse records",body="Diary margin at the second gun: an armed man collected the rinse records and left the seed invoices. He wore no county badge.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=29}},
{id="t0127-31",kind="written",pieces={"letter"},where={{place="mapNamed",spot="ground",lean="agricultural",rival="containment"}},title="Second sad face beside calf tags",body="Letter fragment at the second sad face: twelve calf tags came back from the supplement pasture, but only eleven calves were unloaded.",anchor={map="WorldStashMap18",note=30}},
